      "id": "PR_kwDOI7W0xc8AAAABBKEFXA",
      "title": "Replace Blocknative with public RPC for blob base fee and migrate Eth…",
      "author": "ayaanoncrypto",
      "number": 1800,
      "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\nReplaces the retired Blocknative gas endpoint with an Ethereum JSON-RPC implementation and updates Etherscan calls to API V2. The script now runs safely when imported because execution is guarded by `__main__`.\r\n\r\nFixes #1797.\r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\n\r\nThe focused unit tests for successful and failed RPC responses passed. Ruff formatting passed. The broader suite encountered unrelated DuckDB I/O errors in the sandbox.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nThe change keeps the existing output files and BigQuery upload flow intact.",
